abstract: >-
  AortaCFD is an end-to-end automated pipeline for patient-specific
  cardiovascular CFD simulations using OpenFOAM 12. It streamlines
  the complete workflow from geometry to results, featuring a modular
  architecture with composable configuration fragments, pre-configured
  simulation profiles (Laminar, RANS, LES), and advanced boundary
  conditions including 3-element Windkessel models.
